# slider-drag-30 (h8-points-slider): pressed on the thumb (250, 748: on the
# mark) and moved +30 px, held. P follows the pointer (2.03 -> 3.82), the
# halo and tip follow, P's drop lines show on the plane, the URL stays
# unwritten (shot lands inside the 200 ms debounce). Behaviour: aria 3.82.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 250 748
down
move 280 748 over 80
shot slider-drag-30
up
wait 1200
